{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01809","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古别离 · 孟云卿","name":"杂曲歌辞 古别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝日上高台，离人怨秋草。\n但见万里天，不见万里道。\n君行本遥远，苦乐良难保。\n宿昔梦同衾，忧心梦颠倒。\n含酸欲谁诉，转转伤怀抱。\n结发年已迟，征行去何早。\n寒暄有时谢，顦顇难再好。\n人皆算年寿，死者何曾老。\n少壮无见期，水深风浩浩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}